    <h1 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl lg:text-[28px] font-semibold text-ink tracking-tight mt-0 mb-4 leading-tight text-balance">
        How to Turn a Pasted Screenshot Into an Email Attachment
    </h1>

    <AuthorByline publishDate="2026-09-27" />

    <figure class="my-6 overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-hairline bg-canvas-soft">
        <img src="/blog/paste-screenshot-into-email-attachment.png" alt="Screenshot of the paste tool with an image pasted in, showing its dimensions, file size, and the Download button" width="1600" height="900" class="w-full aspect-[16/9] object-cover" />
